                                                "sense_id": "b8c5947e-cc91-3186-b588-33baf90c6141",
                                                "text": "This motion has been firsted and seconded. I desire to third it."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "81583b37-1cd1-4130-8ab6-6ae295b04f11",
                                                "sense_id": "b8c5947e-cc91-3186-b588-33baf90c6141",
                                                "text": "Sure—er—well, the motion was firsted and seconded that we kick ’em out; […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0aa197ed-afcb-4540-b1bf-6bc4c46e1870",
                                                "sense_id": "b8c5947e-cc91-3186-b588-33baf90c6141",
                                                "text": "Sure, Brother Severn, I second that motion. If you hadn’t got ahead of me I’d have firsted it myself."
